{#
  "Paiements" — the asset's money configuration (§6.19, §6.20).

  Entirely optional and off by default. Without the Finance module this
  section explains that rather than offering a picker with nothing in it: a
  unit that settles its rentals by hand is a perfectly normal unit, and it
  must not meet a half-working screen.

  Two distinct things live here and must not be confused. The DEPOSIT is a
  threshold on the single rental receivable — same communication as the
  balance, because two communications would let a renter settle the wrong
  one. The SECURITY DEPOSIT is a separate receivable with its own
  communication, and never counts as rental revenue.

  The Finance ACCOUNT is deliberately not a field here: it is pinned by the
  unit staff on « Espace chefs d'U > Locations », because the account list
  carries every account's IBAN and a manager may be a parent or a former
  leader. This block therefore reports which account is in force and links to
  the person who can change it, rather than offering a picker.

  Requires `asset`, `payment_settings`, `finance_available`,
  `payment_account_name` and `can_pin_account`.
#}
<div class="card mb-4" id="paiements">
    <div class="card-body">
        <h2 class="h5 mb-1">Paiements</h2>

        {% if not finance_available %}
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-0">
                Le module « Finances » n'est pas actif sur ce site. Les locations fonctionnent
                normalement sans lui : aucune créance n'est créée et le suivi des paiements se fait
                hors ScoutMagic. Activez « Finances » pour demander un acompte, un solde et une
                caution depuis ici.
            </p>
        {% else %}
            <p class="text-body-secondary small mb-3">
                Une seule créance est créée pour toute la location. L'acompte n'est pas une créance
                séparée : c'est un <strong>seuil</strong> atteint dès que le montant reçu l'atteint,
                avec la même communication structurée que le solde. La caution, elle, est bien une
                créance distincte, avec sa propre communication — et elle n'entre jamais dans le
                revenu de location.
            </p>

            <form method="post" action="/mes-locations/{{ asset.slug }}/reglages/paiements">
                {{ csrf_field()|raw }}

                <div class="form-check mb-3">
                    <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="payments-enabled" name="payments_enabled"
                           {{ payment_settings.enabled ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                    <label class="form-check-label" for="payments-enabled">
                        Demander les paiements de ce bien via Finances
                    </label>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <span class="form-label d-block mb-1">Compte</span>
                    {% if payment_account_name %}
                        <p class="mb-1">{{ payment_account_name }}</p>
                    {% else %}
                        <p class="mb-1 fst-italic text-body-secondary">Aucun compte associé.</p>
                    {% endif %}
                    <div class="form-text">
                        Le compte sur lequel les virements sont attendus s'associe depuis
                        {% if can_pin_account %}
                            <a href="/admin/locations?asset_id={{ asset.id }}#compte">« Espace chefs d'U &gt; Locations »</a>.
                        {% else %}
                            « Espace chefs d'U &gt; Locations » — demandez à un chef d'unité de l'associer.
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Acompte</h3>
                <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'deposit-mode', field_name: 'deposit_mode', type: 'select',
                            label: 'Type',
                            options: deposit_modes|map(mode => {
                                value: mode.value,
                                label: mode.label,
                                selected: payment_settings.depositMode.value == mode.value,
                            }),
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'deposit-amount', field_name: 'deposit_amount',
                            label: 'Montant fixe (€)', inputmode: 'decimal',
                            value: payment_settings.depositAmountCents is not null
                                ? (payment_settings.depositAmountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '') : '',
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-2">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'deposit-percentage', field_name: 'deposit_percentage', type: 'number',
                            label: 'Pourcentage', min: 0, max: 100,
                            value: payment_settings.depositPercentage,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-3">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'deposit-due-days', field_name: 'deposit_due_days', type: 'number',
                            label: 'Échéance (jours)', min: 0,
                            help: 'Après la confirmation.',
                            value: payment_settings.depositDueDays,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label" for="balance-due-days">Échéance du solde (jours)</label>
                    <input type="number" min="0" class="form-control" id="balance-due-days"
                           name="balance_due_days" value="{{ payment_settings.balanceDueDays }}"
                           style="max-width: 12rem;">
                    <div class="form-text">Après la confirmation également. Laissez vide pour ne rien annoncer.</div>
                </div>

                <h3 class="h6 mt-4">Caution</h3>
                <p class="text-body-secondary small">
                    La caution fait l'objet d'une créance distincte, avec sa propre communication.
                    Sa <strong>restitution se saisit à la main</strong> : Finances rapproche les
                    virements entrants, pas les sortants — c'est une limite assumée, pas un oubli.
                </p>
                <div class="row g-3 mb-3">
                    <div class="col-12 col-md-4">
                        <div class="form-check mt-4">
                            <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="security-deposit-enabled"
                                   name="security_deposit_enabled"
                                   {{ payment_settings.securityDepositEnabled ? 'checked' : '' }}>
                            <label class="form-check-label" for="security-deposit-enabled">
                                Demander une caution
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-4">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'security-deposit-amount', field_name: 'security_deposit_amount',
                            label: 'Montant (€)', inputmode: 'decimal',
                            value: payment_settings.securityDepositAmountCents is not null
                                ? (payment_settings.securityDepositAmountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', '') : '',
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                    <div class="col-6 col-md-4">
                        {% include 'partials/form_field.html.twig' with {
                            field_id: 'security-deposit-due-days', field_name: 'security_deposit_due_days',
                            type: 'number', label: 'Échéance (jours)', min: 0,
                            value: payment_settings.securityDepositDueDays,
                        } only %}
                    </div>
                </div>

                <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">Enregistrer les paiements</button>
            </form>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</div>
